    "explicit_scope": "PersonInput carries SessionMachine scope/flow epoch plus captured profile generation/key/tenure. observe_session checks explicit edges before controlled recovery suppression and before any landing; supersede retires requests, terminals, stamps, outbox, backoffs and seed latches. Only mounted header is held; account/server evidence is cleared with unchanged roster.",
    "addressed_terminal": "PersonPort checks full Addr and complete pending PersonReq (including slot/generation/args/identity/client keys) before either completion or launch refusal. A typed PersonLaunchRefused queues exactly one addressed terminal. Bridge::start_jobs consumes it before returning; owner releases its claim, arms 120-frame retry and marks attempted profile. No same-drain retry loop. Permanent Landing::Refused and tape mail/admission layouts are unchanged."
